Article 13 (Applicability to appointment of safety officers in construction business)
The amended provisions of subparagraph 46 of and the note to Appendix 3 shall apply to construction works commencing on or after the dates according to the classifications prescribed in the subparagraphs of Article 2 (4) of the Addenda.
Article 14 (Applicability to appointment of health officers in construction business)
