3. A place of business under the amended provisions of subparagraph 2 of Article 96-2: August 18, 2023.
Article 3 (Applicability to number of safety officers required to be appointed)
The amended provisions of subparagraphs 3, 21, 23, 24, and 27 of Appendix 3 shall begin to apply from February 19, 2023, where the number of regular employees is at least 500 but less than 1,000.
Article 4 (Transitional measures concerning persons in office at asbestos dismantlers or removers)
A person who is employed by an asbestos dismantler or remover as personnel dedicated to duties related to asbestos dismantlement or removal in accordance with the classifications specified in the previous provisions of the items of subparagraph 1 of Appendix 28, but who fails to meet the human resources requirements under the amended provisions of the items of subparagraph 1 of Appendix 28 as at the time this Decree enters into force, shall be deemed to meet the human resources requirements under the amended provisions of subparagraph 1 of Appendix 28 in accordance with the following classifications, limited to the period such person is employed by the relevant asbestos dismantler or remover as personnel dedicated to duties related to asbestos dismantlement or removal:
1. A person who falls under the previous provisions of subparagraph 1 (a) (i) of Appendix 28: The human resources requirements under the amended provisions of subparagraph 1 (a) of Appendix 28;
2. A person who falls under the previous provisions of subparagraph 1 (b) of Appendix 28: The human resources requirements under the amended provisions of subparagraph 1 (b) of Appendix 28.

